{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Shopping Spree"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Trend Setters"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le07ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making Comparisons"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">as</span> + adjective/adverb + <span class=\"italic\">as</span> to make comparisons when the things we are comparing are equal in some way:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket is <span class=\"strong\">as soft as</span> a sweater!</span><br/><br/>We use <span class=\"italic\">not as ... as</span> to make comparisons between things which aren't equal:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket is<span class=\"strong\">n't as expensive as</span> that one.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm not <span class=\"strong\">as tuned into the fashion scene as</span> you are, Sal."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I don't find hipster style <span class=\"strong\">as interesting as</span> other ways of dressing."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Being a follower is not <span class=\"strong\">as compelling as</span> standing out in a crowd. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Being seen in some worlds is <span class=\"strong\">just as important as</span> blending in others. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I can be <span class=\"strong\">as hipster as</span> the next person!"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Superlatives and Comparatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use a comparative to compare somebody or something to <span class=\"strong\">one</span> other person or thing.<br/><br/>You use a superlative to compare somebody or something to the whole <span class=\"strong\">group</span> that he, she or it belongs to."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for information on how to form the comparative and superlative:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"big\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bigger\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the biggest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Most adjectives:<br/><br/>+er, +-est\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"late\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"later\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the latest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjectives ending in -e:<br/><br/>+r, +-st\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thrifty\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thriftier\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the thriftiest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2-syllable adje\u00ad\u00ad\u00adctives ending in -y:<br/><br/>+ier, +iest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ridiculous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more ridiculous \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most ridiculous \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"3+-syllable adjectives:<br/><br/>more + adjective<br/><br/>most + adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good<br/>bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better (than)<br/>worse (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best<br/>the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular comparisons\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>you use <span class=\"strong\">than</span> after comparatives</li><li>you add <span class=\"strong\">the</span> in front of the superlative form to describe people, places and things.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "That's the most ridiculous way to socialize I've ever heard!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think you have to buck the bigger trends. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I don't think it's a better lifestyle, just a more distinctive one. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "They are the thriftiest bunch. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It's a cheaper way to live."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hip"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "cool"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It seems that all the hippest trend setters are wearing it these days. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about hipsters."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "faux"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "made to look real, but not real"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She's wear a faux fur coat."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ironic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "saying one thing, but meaning another "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The saying on her T-shirt is ironic. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gingham"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "cotton cloth with two colors in a square pattern."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:Those gingham tops are good to wear in summer heat."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "paisley"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "patterned with curved shapes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The paisley tops are totally hip."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "contrived"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "artificial"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Hipster style seems so contrived!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to buck"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go against"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You have to buck the bigger trends to stand out from the crowd."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "thrifty"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "using money carefully"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They are the thriftiest bunch because it's cheaper."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob07aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of some activities you like to do and places you like to go with friends."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss which activities are better and which are you favorite (use comparatives and superlatives)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph describing your perfect weekend."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about socializing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I compare social activities and say which ones I like best."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about the perfect social weekend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my paragraph aloud and correct any errors I find."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about socializing, fashion and clothing."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can make comparisons using <span class=\"italic\">as ... as</span> and <span class=\"italic\">not as</span>."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can compare two things or people and describe the quality of an object or a person. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What do you know about fashion trends?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How much do you consider the latest trends when you shop for new clothes?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Is a hipster lifestyle better than other lifestyles?"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type"