re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le07ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le07ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Melodie was saying that vintage clothing is making a comeback.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes. It seems that all the hippest trend setters are wearing it these days.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not as tuned into the fashion scene as you are, Sal.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I do read the latest fashion sheets at work. All of the hipsters are into vintage clothing. They're driving some of the styles we see in stores.  <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: All those skinny jeans , faux glasses and ironic tops in gingham and paisley. It's a little folksy and Americana. Personally I don't find hipster style as interesting as other ways of dressing. It all seems so contrived!", "id": 1}, {"time": "32000", "image": "engenn8le07ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think you have to buck the bigger trends. Being a follower is not as compelling as standing out in a crowd. Being seen in some worlds is just as important as blending in others. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How do hipsters socialize? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, some grow vegetables in garden plots together.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Really? That's the most ridiculous way to socialize I've ever heard!", "id": 2}, {"time": "52000", "image": "engenn8le07ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: They go to nightclubs and hang out in cafes. The ride their bikes together everywhere. I don't think it's a better lifestyle, just a more distinctive one. They are the thriftiest bunch. It's a cheaper way to live.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm ... browsing through thrift stores for lower-priced clothing ... I can be as hipster as the next person!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I didn't see that one coming!", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}